General Thematics makes home appliances and other consumer goods, a competitor to [[Org/Concordia/index|Concordia]]. [[Org/Belvedere|Belvedere]] kept a large partnership with the company as a way to keep Concordia appliances out of its laboratories. Along with [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt]], General Thematics began pulling back from its contracts with Belvedere and the Qureshi family, saying it meant to focus elsewhere without saying where. The Party advised Benny's father to hold the company to its contract.
